  "description": "<p>There is a new RFC defining the Content-Disposition header, it has deprecated many of the parts that we use in Fedora. These are now deprecated in Spring and as such we should move away from using them.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6266#appendix-B\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6266#appendix-B</a> </p>",
